abstract: >-
  R Markdown scripts for CITE-seq, cytometry, and bulk RNA-seq analyses
  accompanying the study "TNF blockade with certolizumab improves the efficacy
  of anti-PD-1 and anti-CTLA-4 combination therapy for melanoma"
  (medRxiv, doi:10.64898/2026.02.11.26346073).
